# done_racks.txt — PDU refresh completion ledger.
#
# One rack id per line, exactly as it appears in `deviceslot` (s<datahall>-r<rack>).
# Blank lines and `#` comments are ignored.
#
# Append a rack the moment its PDU swap is VERIFIED complete. Once a rack is
# listed it counts as done for EVERY org that had a node in it — that is what
# makes the per-org "remaining racks" math correct.
#
# Copy this file to done_racks.txt (the default DONE_FILE) before first use:
#     cp done_racks.txt.example done_racks.txt
#
# Point elsewhere with --done <file> or DONE_FILE=<file>.

# s2-r003
# s2-r004
# s2-r005
